# Validate and prepare a mission on the drone. Served by a mission framework node at the
# load_service_path it advertises in MissionStatus.
#
# Loading never starts a flight: the operator does, through mullet_core's start_mission. The
# reply only says whether the spec was accepted for preparation; the framework then runs its
# preflight checks and reports READY or FAULT in MissionStatus. A new load replaces the
# previous mission and is refused while one is running.
string spec_json    # Framework-defined JSON document; its "schema" key names the format,
                    # e.g. "ergodic/1", and must match MissionStatus.spec_schema.
---
bool accepted
string reason       # Why the spec was refused. Empty when accepted.
string mission_id   # Identifier the framework reports in MissionStatus for this mission.
